# A copy of Time Stop ends the turn as well (CR 707.10): Lutri, cast with Time Stop on the stack, copies it as it enters,
# and the copy resolves first. Every object on the stack is exiled (CR 724.1b), so the original Time Stop never resolves:
# it is exiled, and the copy, exiled too, ceases to exist (CR 704.5e). The turn ends; the next is Bot2's.

